msgctxt "236"
msgid "Amazing, buddy! You're the best mahjong player in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "From now on, you're going to have to defend your title."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Mahjong players will work their way up the ranks in order to challenge the "
"best player. As of right now, that's you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I wonder how long you can hold onto your position at the top..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Keep battling any who may take you on, you're the best mahjong player we've "
"got here in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hey, good job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"It looks like you've been working up a sweat defending your title. Keep it "
"up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Hey, good job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Come on back whenever you want to try climbing the ranks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Here, we hold the Rising Dragon Cup, where players compete to determine the "
"best mahjong player in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Back again, buddy? Why not give the Rising Dragon Cup a shot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Skilled mahjong players from all over are signing up for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"It's 50,000 yen to sign up for the rankings. Once you're signed up, you can "
"play mahjong whenever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "You'll be able to earn better and better prizes each time your rank goes up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"If you manage to reach the top of the rankings, you'll win somethin' "
"that'll really make your eyes pop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "So how 'bout it? Gonna try and climb your way up the ranks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Hmm... Sure, sign me up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Great! I'm just gonna need 50,000 yen before I can put your name down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Thanks, man. So, you wanna get started right away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Yeah, I'll give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Well then, good luck, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Not now. I'll come back later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"You sure? Well, your name's on the list, so you can play a Ranked Match "
"whenever you feel like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(I don't have enough money...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What's wrong? Don't got enough?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Well, you can sign up for the rankings whenever you want, so just come back "
"with 50,000 yen when you get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Not now. I'll come back later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"You sure? Well, registration's always open, so come back whenever you feel "
"like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Back again, buddy? How's about a Ranked Match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Back again, Champ? Ready to defend your title?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "How about it? Wanna go for a Kamurocho Ranked Match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Yeah, I'll give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Well then, good luck, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
